{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22249","headline":"达理二首 二 · 白居易","name":"达理二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舒姑化爲泉，牛哀病作虎。\n或柳生肘间，或男变爲女。\n鸟兽及水木，本不与民伍。\n胡然生变迁，不待死归土。\n百骸是己物，尚不能爲主。\n况彼时命间，倚伏何足数。\n时来不可遏，命去焉能取。\n唯当养浩然，吾闻达人语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}